Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a glorious place.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.31,0:00:12.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Quality Control
