Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek freedom, and it will lie\Nstretched out before your eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the endless dream guides\Nyour restless spirit,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Timing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,209)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,270)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}PhosCity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seize it, raise your flag, and stand tall.
