Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.44,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}arch1t3cht\NExecutor\NFunimation\Nrangicus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way from the moon's sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is what I am for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far\Nfrom where my search began,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over seas of green and shores of sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some days somewhere I'll finally see\Nthe light I will search for everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My money says that we lived through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cloud road that goes straight up,\Nyou might want to reconsider that bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this is a natural\Nformation of the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing natural about this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They put up a big sign\Nshowing us! Godland?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is Godland, Skypiea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:02:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.51,0:03:04.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,715)\fscx75\fscy90\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord1.8\1a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(481,0)\t(0,563,3,\c&H000000&)\t(0,481,\1a&H00&)\b1}God Land, Skypiea\NWhite-White Sea
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.51,0:03:04.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,715)\fscx75\fscy90\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(481,0)\b1}God Land, Skypiea\NWhite-White Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, didn't the sign\Nwe passed say Skypiea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the same name scribbled\Non the map that Lock found.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I guess that galleon that\Nfell on us actually did come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time they set eyes\Non this was 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed that this place has\Nstayed beautiful for so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.13,0:03:38.96,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,733)\fscx120\fscy120\c&H0D0D0E&\3c&H0D0D0E&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(1809,0)\t(1764,1809,\1a&H00&)}Angel Beach
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.13,0:03:38.96,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,733)\fscx120\fscy120\bord0\c&HFBFAF7&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(1809,0)}Angel Beach
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can smell the adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putin is the seaweed in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me! I like adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, did you hurt yourself? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it just me or is this\Nwhole place made of clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big fluffy ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go ashore. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm coming with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too, but I got to change first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we may have a problem\Nwith dropping anchor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no seabed at the\Nbottom of this cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I thought about\Nthat, and who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.37,0:04:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the way you think. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I want to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come down and check\Nthis out, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beach is actually fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It squishes between my\Ntoes like marshmallow mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is marshmallow mud?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but that's what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, regardless of how the ground\Nmay feel, it sure is an amazing sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better than I imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a piece of work for sure, but I\Nthink our shipmates are overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.47,0:04:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bugs me when they get all worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they get all worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We forgot about the South Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really should have let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birds adapt very quickly\Nto their environments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if not, there seem to be\Nsome people living up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hit the heavier cloud below, which\Nis what I think this place floats on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means that Sky Island\Nfloats on a sea of cloud cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's stationary in the\Nsky or if it moves with the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could sit on deck all day\Nand pick this whole thing apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what fun would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fact is, most of this makes zero\Nsense, so let's make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why we came here, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:05:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can do this, so can you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swordsman, you joining us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.29,0:06:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.91,0:06:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be along soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain smells adventure. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never stop to think of\Nany of this as adventurous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should reconsider my stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, something about the squishiness of\Nthis island makes me want to sleep all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your captain speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.73,0:06:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must inform you that\Nthis place is too much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fun for me to make any\Nmore captain decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we just\Nsit around and do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing sounds like a plan to me. Denied!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But denied means no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such mysterious-looking flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're balloonish\Nlike that sea monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll pop when I pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.27,0:07:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those marine losers can't follow\Nus up here so we can all cut loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, what do you\Nthink that is over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giant Fruit, you're all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.77,0:07:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this thing so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got some fruit for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You practically crammed\Nmy brain into my chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Robin, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.03,0:07:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An island flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one for...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, baby, where'd you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a gift for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I want\Na chair made of cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they have a factory\Nthat makes all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cloud is different\Nfrom the stuff on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lot of fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't figure on getting\Nwet walking through clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that music?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On that cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can ask the Second to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not who you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That right there is an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Esso?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.31,0:08:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Esso?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:09:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sue, come here. Sue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you come from the Blue Sea World?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you call it, we sealed\Nup a river of clouds to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of here, is this your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.09,0:09:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.09,0:09:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to welcome you\Nto Skypia's Angel Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you'd like to drink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The top of a konash is as hard as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to crack, so you have\Nto cut through the underside, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's that good, I gotta try some!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.62,0:09:49.83,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,729.89)\fscx75\fscy90\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord2\1a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(800,800)\b1\t(0,800,\1a&H00&)\t(8410,8455,\1a&HFF&)\t(0,856,3,\c&H000000&)}Conis & Cloud Fox Su\NAngel Beach, Skypiea Residents
Dialogue: 2,0:09:40.62,0:09:49.83,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,729.89)\fscx75\fscy90\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(800,800)\b1}Conis & Cloud Fox Su\NAngel Beach, Skypiea Residents
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Conis, and\Nthis little one is Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a cloud fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need anything at all,\Nplease let me be of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are setting my heart on...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, we've got tons of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to bother you, but we've\Nnever been anyplace like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, ask me anything you\Nwant to know. Guys, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House, Conis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you say hello like normal people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis, what's that thing he's riding on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that would be my father's waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sky waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gangway!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping this thing is a bit of a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who crashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, didn't you bring back\Nsomething like that waver from the seabed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I did, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that must be the boat we read\Nabout in that Noland the Liar book,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a boat that can sail without wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you make some new\Nfriends? Conis, my dear? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They arrived only a few minutes\Nago from the Blue Sea World.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, still adjusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a great many things that\Npuzzle you about the White White Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.05,0:11:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for not\Nintroducing myself sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Pagaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.79,0:11:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Father, how was the fishing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a successful venture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should all come over for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fill your bellies with\Nthe taste of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out for that! I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island Cuisine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I help you prepare it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we go, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boat, it doesn't have\Nany sails to catch the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you weren't rowing it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how's it propelled through the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your people aren't familiar\Nwith dials, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Order dials!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have let a\Nrookie use the waiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since Luffy can't swim, I hope\Nthis sea is more buoyant than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it can stay floating in the\Nair, then you're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.83,0:12:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the first time I've been wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close. Close?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were standing on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know about close?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, and thanks for\Nall the help, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really necessary\Nfor you to jump in, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for letting\Nhim take the waver out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With its light body, even a\Nsmall wave can shake the rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you know the white, white\Nsea like the back of your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the waver is almost impossible to ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Ken, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only recently that I\Nbecame good enough to ride it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is it really that hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It usually takes ten years\Nof training to drive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami, you're a\Nvision riding that waver!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is her first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how come she can do it and I can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this really requires skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.29,0:13:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder you had a hard time, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, we're invited to dinner, so get\Noff that thing and stop being so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid Waverhog! Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's okay with Peak, yeah, I'd\Nlike to stay out here and ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riding this freely on\Nthe open ocean without
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worrying about the wind is like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we can use these\Non our ocean back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that some kind of factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is our cloud quarry site.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.89,0:13:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's where our clouds are manufactured\Nand cut to meet all types of needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could cut a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did take the Milky Road to get\Nto the White White Sea, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Milky Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the name of that messed\Nup current we took up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a canal constructed by our engineers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.71,0:14:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and made using the\Nnatural clouds we quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are actually two types of\Nnatural clouds on our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ship traveled atop\Nwhat we call sea clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the ones that float on their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we can stand on and build on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are called island clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.69,0:14:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not the normal clouds\Nthat we're used to, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Their condensation\Nnucleus is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what you usually see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to do with a mineral found in the\Nblue sea world Called sea prism stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.17,0:14:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea prism stone What effect\Ndoes that have on the clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside the sea prism\Nare carnelian particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called pyrobrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During volcanic eruptions, these particles\Ngain moisture and descend into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our clouds are formed based on\Nthe density of the moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I heard about those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.63,0:14:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember that from when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We used to always play with\Ncarnelian particles in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough sarcasm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all actuality, there are three types\Nof clouds that we use in our day-to-day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea and island types are natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.09,0:15:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man-made ones come from island clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll follow me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the view from up here. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you squint, you can\Nsee Nami riding the waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what are you waiting on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come she's so good\Nat that stupid thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sonja.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just made me bite my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm bleeding. Poor baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pagaya, which way to the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I saw this stuff sitting\Nin your fridge and I, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never seen anything like it, so I\Ntried it and, and it tastes like death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm all dizzy and\Nmy tongue feels swollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you drank some spoiled sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why did you leave\Nthis stuff sitting around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're having\Nfun in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Sanji's just excited about Sky\NIsland food being such a new thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, I was wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could you explain some more to us about\Nthese dials you mentioned earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't exactly know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I've never been this relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look like a\Ndial, it's just a seashell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, at first glance, but why don't\Nyou put it to your mouth and talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp Sting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you always pick on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, just press down\Nthe apex of the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna tell me what an apex is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.49,0:16:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means vertex, our highest point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp Sting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seashell's making fun of Usopp too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I ever do to you, seashell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, just press down\Nthe apex of the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:16:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a neat trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.97,0:17:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we can store any\Nsound and play it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that shell is one of the dials.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we call this one a tone dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shell from the white, white sea\Nthat records and replays whatever it hears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think there was\Na bottom to your sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.49,0:17:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do these things live, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They live in the shallows\Nin the cloud reefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't see how that little thing\Ncould move your father's sky waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.13,0:17:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's because this is\Nthe kind that powers the waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's smaller, but it does\Ndemonstrate the same process.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this one blows wind\Nout of its backside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is called a breath dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It allows you the ability to store\Nthe wind and expel it at your desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind capacity varies depending\Non the size of the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you attach the right size to the stern\Nof a ship You can move along swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The waver moved by blowing a stream of\Nwind through the water. That waver is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dials don't just power wavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's also the skating\Nkind of the board kind, but I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't go for those the wavers\Nabout as crazy as I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I was out there on\Nthat thing instead of Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I could be if I could figure\Nout how to fix the one we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you ever find\Na waver in your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's kind of hard to\Neven tell if that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that hunk of\Njunk is 200 years old
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a total wreck There's no way it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might not be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dials are made from the\Nremains of dead shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can last indefinitely so long\Nas the shell itself isn't broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never said anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd venture a guess there\Nare many types of dials.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's a lamp dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It lit up from inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are flame dials\Nthat store heat and fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:19:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flavor dials that store\Nvarious tastes and aromas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.33,0:19:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And vision dials that store\Neverything the user sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.23,0:19:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which you can watch again and again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to live in the clouds\Nfor the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we couldn't really sustain life here\Nin the clouds without these dials.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.91,0:19:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our culture has evolved with the dials.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose in the same way they\Nevolved with the white white sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, dinner is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have for you Sky\NLobster with special sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a side of island fruits\Nthat I can't pronounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, it tastes sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have expected it from lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, any of you know where Nami is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:19:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's riding the Waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She probably went out too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have some of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think she's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have my concerns, but I\Ncan't say one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a place called the Upper Yard that\Nno one is ever allowed to set foot on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.27,0:20:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would only be a short\Ntrip by Waver from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your friend Nami might have\Nset ashore there out of curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so bad that no one can\Never go over to this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.99,0:20:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it full of monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sacred ground. Sacred ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's so much more than just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.65,0:20:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the island where God lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

